    ["向锁定目标发射光束造成*d点魔法伤害，光束会向其周围的敌方目标折射最多<HighLight>3</>次，每次折射都会使光束对下一名目标的伤害降低<HighLight>5%</>。光束有<HighLight>60%</>的基础概率对命中的目标施加<HighLight>0.7</>秒的<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\">滞涩</>，只命中一个目标时，伤害提升至*d点。施法后获得20点<HighLight>神秘知识</>。自身拥有<HighLight>知识灌注</>时，本技能获得<HighLight>强化</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>强化</>：伤害基础值提高至*d点，折射次数增加1次且折射时伤害不再衰减，只命中一个目标时伤害提升至*d点。使所有命中目标的buffdisc(*id)点，持续<HighLight>3.5</>秒；有<HighLight>70%</>基础概率使其移速降低<HighLight>50%</>，持续<HighLight>2.5</>秒。释放非强化的<HighLight>光之折射</>时返还<HighLight>2</>秒冷却时间。\n<FaintYellow>神秘知识</>：最多拥有100点。达到100点时解锁<HighLight>终结技能信息洪流</>。"] = "Fire a beam at the locked target to deal *d magic damage. The beam will refract to nearby enemy targets up to 3 <HighLight></> times, with each refraction reducing the beam's damage to the next target by 5% <HighLight></>. The beam has a 60% <HighLight></> base probability of applying Stagnation <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"6\"></> for 0.7 <HighLight></> seconds; if it only hits one target, damage is increased to *d. Gain 20 points of Mysterious Knowledge <HighLight></> after casting. When you possess Knowledge Infusion <HighLight></>, this skill gains Strengthening <HighLight></>. \n\n<FaintYellow> Strengthening </>: Base damage increased to *d, refraction count increased by 1, and damage no longer decays upon refraction. If it only hits one target, damage is increased to *d. Applies buffdisc(*id) to all hit targets for 3.5 <HighLight></> seconds; has a 70% <HighLight></> base probability of reducing their movement speed by 50% <HighLight></> for 2.5 <HighLight></> seconds. Casting a non-strengthened Refraction of Light <HighLight></> refunds 2 <HighLight></> seconds of Cooldown. \n<FaintYellow> Mysterious Knowledge </>: Maximum of 100 points. Upon reaching 100 points, unlock the Finisher Skill Vortex of Knowledge <HighLight></>.",
